### Create a new extension
POST http://localhost:3000/extension
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "website-crawler",
    "description": "Crawl and extract content from websites using headless browser",
    "version": "1.0.0"
}

### Get all extensions
GET http://localhost:3000/extension

### Get a specific extension
GET http://localhost:3000/extension/1

### Update an extension
PUT http://localhost:3000/extension/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "google-docs",
    "description": "Updated Google Docs extension with new features",
    "version": "1.1.0",
    "config": {
        "clientId": "updated-client-id",
        "clientSecret": "updated-client-secret",
        "redirectUri": "http://localhost:3000/auth/google/callback",
        "scopes": ["https://www.googleapis.com/auth/documents"]
    }
}

### Delete an extension
DELETE http://localhost:3000/extension/1

### Get extension tools
GET http://localhost:3000/extension/1/tools

### Get all available extension directories
GET http://localhost:3000/extension/available/list

### Test an extension
POST http://localhost:3000/extension/1/test
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "input": {
        "documentId": "test-doc-id",
        "content": "Test content"
    }
}

### Create Tavily extension
POST http://localhost:3000/extension
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "tavily",
    "description": "Web search using Tavily API",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "config": {
        "apiKey": "{{TAVILY_API_KEY}}"
    }
}

### Test Tavily web search
POST http://localhost:3000/extension/2/test
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "input": "What are the latest developments in AI?"
} 